Creators like @vaibhavsisinty scale to multi-million followings by packaging AI into viral mainstream news and real-life anomalies, such as Bengaluru AI cameras fining a scooter rider for carrying a guitar or voice-controlled Grok Tesla parking. @garvit.irl remains tightly confined to student/fresher hacks (free certificates, free tokens), missing broader top-of-funnel algorithmic discovery from curious general tech audiences.


